{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51388","headline":"南窜途中感愤（句） · 李德谷","name":"南窜途中感愤（句）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（李卫公历三朝大权，出门下者多矣。\n及南窜，怨嫌并集，途中感愤，有句云：）十五余年车马客，无人相送到崖州。\n（《唐语林》七《补遗》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51388.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51388","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}